            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kä cu buɔ̱n ji̱ Juda diaal, kɛ bööth palä kɛ ji̱ Lii-bay kɛ buɔ̱n ji̱ I-thɛ-rɛl, kɛ nɛy tin cieŋ muun I-thɛ-rɛl kɛ nɛy tin cieŋ kä Juda lo̱ckiɛn tɛɛth ɛlɔ̱ŋ. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 30:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inɔ cuɛ tekɛ tɛth lɔaac mi di̱i̱t kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm, kɛ ɣöö nikɛ ni̱n ruëc Thɔ-lo-mon gat Dee-bid kuäär I-thɛ-rɛl, thilɛ mi ce̱tkɛ nɛmɛ mi ca kɔn la̱t kä Jɛ-ru-tha-lɛm. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.30.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.30.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
